">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:64.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 36.0000%); display:inline-block;\">80%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 0 1px 1px; width:0.0000%; background-color:#ff3333; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:80.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 20.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>West of <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, in a some <a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Mines\">Lost Mines</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tIn all aspects this creature is almost identical to <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghoul</a>. So treat Undead Prospector the same as you would treat a normal <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghoul</a>.<br/><br/>An undead prospector attacks in melee range. An undead prospector never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tSince they don't appear in packs, they can be killed easily as you would kill a single <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghoul</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on March 04, 2025, the patch added a \"semi-rare\" chance of looting <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> from this creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 64 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Worm\"><img alt=\"Worm\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"asse